WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.989
Social links can be added, reordered, or removed.

00:00:04.039 --> 00:00:07.889
Choose the network and enter its full profile address.

00:00:07.939 --> 00:00:13.089
The WhatsApp switch controls the floating contact button on the website.

00:00:13.139 --> 00:00:18.216
Saving these changes keeps them as a draft until Settings is published.
